    <name>Mayne Island out-and-back paddle</name>
    <desc>Public-beach-to-public-beach out-and-back kayak route in the waters off Mayne Island, BC, Canada. Track geometry only (no timestamps, pace, heart rate, or device data) extracted from a real personal paddling activity, downsampled from 5549 to 140 GPS points; retrieved 2026-08-06. Used here only as a realistic GPS route for synthetic seed data -- not associated with any real activity metrics.</desc>
